oad/t_thumb/scpzw1.jpg"}, {"id": 1212914, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scpzw2.jpg"}, {"id": 1212915, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scpzw3.jpg"}, {"id": 1212916, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scpzw4.jpg"}, {"id": 1212917, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scpzw5.jpg"}, {"id": 1212918, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scpzw6.jpg"}, {"id": 1212919, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scpzw7.jpg"}], "slug": "true-stalker", "storyline": "True Stalker follows the story of an ordinary stalker known as \u201cTopor.\u201d He makes small forays but hasn\u2019t yet dared to leave the newbie zone, the Cordon. His goal is to gain enough experience and gear to venture to the Chernobyl NPP, track down rare artifacts or even reach the Wish Granter.\n\nThe game\u2019s progression roughly mirrors Shadow of Chernobyl: after the Cordon, Topor heads to the Garbage, then drops by the Bar, and finally explores various underground sites, including Lab X-18.\n\nAlong the way, he\u2019ll search for missing stalkers, aid scientists and ultimately pursue his dream of meeting the Wish Granter at the NPP.", "summary": "The plot centers on a run\u2011of\u2011the\u2011mill Stalker nicknamed Topor. He\u2019s made several forays into the Chernobyl Exclusion Zone, yet\u2014even though the Zone\u2019s heart beckons\u2014his fear of the unknown always holds him at the Cordon\u2019s edge. But life beyond the perimeter has long since lost its meaning, so at last he resolves to venture beyond the Cordon\u2026", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/true-stalker", "videos": [{"id": 103768, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "OaA5Jpbx8hU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OaA5Jpbx8hU", "title": "True Stalker - Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/OaA5Jpbx8hU/maxresdef